      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## About this workflow\n\nOne picture to an untextured 3D shape, saved as `.glb` in `output/3d/`, in about a minute; for colour and textures use the Pixal3D templates. BiRefNet cuts the subject out and centres it on white first. Without that step Hunyuan3D also models the picture's backdrop, as a wall behind the object.\n\nThe middle node is ComfyUI's **Image to Model (Hunyuan3d 2.1)** blueprint, the one in the node search box; double-click it to see inside. The sample picture, a knight figurine, ships with the template pack.\n\nAsset profile: `hunyuan3d-2.1-core`."
      ]
    }
  ],
